teps and a practical final review checklist.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/design/china/china-2-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-19\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-20\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/csc-scholarship-application/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I submit only in the CSC system?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Not necessarily. Many routes also require a university or national nomination application. Follow the current call.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long should the study plan be?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Use the programme’s own word-count and language requirements. There is no single length appropriate for every host.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I edit after submission?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Portal rules differ. Review everything first and ask the responsible office about corrections rather than assuming editing remains available.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L17"}],false,"$L18","$L19"]}]
